aracteristics | Best For |\n --- \n| 60-65% | Stiff, easy to handle, potentially thicker crust | Bagels, pretzels, pizza, some pan loaves |\n| 65-70% | Balanced, manageable, good structure | Classic breads, beginner-friendly sourdough |\n| 70-75% | Moderately op"}, {"cite_id": "W4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u2k-UiQGLGA&vl=en", "title": "Best Hydration for Homemade Sourdough Bread?", "domain": "www.youtube.com", "score": 0.7065, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-27T18:11:38.483Z", "snippet": "# Best Hydration for Homemade Sourdough Bread?\n## Channel: Gluten Morgen (verified)\n341K subscribers\n3.9K likes\n\n### Description\n202,880 views\nPosted: 2025-05-18\nWhat is the best hydration for making sourdough bread at home? We have the answer! Typically, sourdough bread goes bet"}]}}
